nagement","s":"Dan H. Arnold","x":"Turning to continuous improvement, our focus last year was on delivering improvements that help streamline processes, modernize policies and enhance ClientWorks.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/01/lpl-financial-holdings-inc-lpla-q4-2018-earnings-c.aspx"},{"c":"LPLA 2019 Q1","e":"lpla","d":"2019-05-02","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Dan Arnold","x":"With these separate capabilities integrated into one streamline workflow, our advisors can now more efficiently add clients to their practice.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/03/lpl-financial-holdings-lpla-q1-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"LPLA 2019 Q3","e":"lpla","d":"2019-10-24","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Dan Arnold","x":"We think that they will protect most of their pricing power.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/25/lpl-financial-holdings-lpla-q3-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"LPLA 2019 Q3","e":"lpla","d":"2019-10-24","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Dan Arnold","x":"…then if we wrap technology around them to help enrich their value proposition, personalization, easier access, solving more complex problems and making them more efficient, we think ultimately, it's a really compelling and interesting opportunity set that can preserve most of their pricing power.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/25/lpl-financial-holdings-lpla-q3-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"LPLA 2019 Q3","e":"lpla","d":"2019-10-24","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Dan Arnold","x":"We are seeing early benefits in the form of streamlining the process and expediting the time it takes to activate an account once it's been opened.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/25/lpl-financial-holdings-lpla-q3-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"LPLA 2021 Q1","e":"lpla","d":"2021-04-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Dan H. Arnold","x":"We also co